Derived MIME registry facts from Python 3.14.6 mimetypes and this qualification
host's Debian media-types /etc/mime.types. The JSON records the input SHA-256.
Debian /usr/share/doc/media-types/copyright states:
Files: *
Copyright: public-domain
License: ad-hoc
 This package contains public information compiled from around the 'net and
 many people.
